WEBVTT

00:08.700 --> 00:15.310
<b>Picking up the yesterday
that someone threw away</b>

00:15.310 --> 00:18.650
<b>I just reached my hand
out like a daredevil</b>

00:18.650 --> 00:21.950
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:21.950 --> 00:27.390
<b>No matter what I get, I
won't ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.590 --> 00:34.530
<b>Escape from the gaps in
your tangled up heart</b>

00:34.530 --> 00:36.600
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.600 --> 00:41.840
<b>I hear your voice
in the rusted time</b>

00:41.840 --> 00:44.870
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.870 --> 00:48.140
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.140 --> 00:51.750
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.750 --> 00:55.410
<b>Right away</b>

01:05.960 --> 01:08.000
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.000 --> 01:13.240
<b>I search for myself
in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.240 --> 01:16.340
<b>I want to seize it
with my own hands</b>

01:16.340 --> 01:19.570
<b>You are waiting, no
matter where I am</b>

01:19.570 --> 01:23.150
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.150 --> 01:25.810
<b>Right away</b>

01:34.020 --> 01:35.690
<b>It's cold!</b>

01:35.690 --> 01:37.760
<b>It's gotten really chilly.</b>

01:37.760 --> 01:40.430
<b>And it's not even as if
we're in a cold climate.</b>

01:40.430 --> 01:43.060
<b>I hate the cold.</b>

01:43.060 --> 01:48.140
<b>Who the hell was whining about being
too hot a couple of days ago?!</b>

01:48.140 --> 01:52.140
<b>Oh, shut up! I hate the cold too!</b>

01:52.140 --> 01:54.670
<b>Hey, Hakkai, when are we...</b>

01:56.850 --> 01:57.710
<b>Hakkai?</b>

01:57.710 --> 01:58.350
<b>Oh, don't worry. We'll be
arriving at a town soon.
Hakkai?</b>

01:58.350 --> 02:02.450
<b>Oh, don't worry. We'll be
arriving at a town soon.</b>

02:02.450 --> 02:05.750
<b>Look, we'll see it once
we're over that hill.</b>

02:05.750 --> 02:09.960
<b>Hakkai, how do you know?
Have you been there before?</b>

02:09.960 --> 02:11.290
<b>Yes, well...</b>

02:11.290 --> 02:11.460
<b>Oh, I didn't know.
Yes, well...</b>

02:11.460 --> 02:13.400
<b>Oh, I didn't know.</b>

02:13.400 --> 02:16.060
<b>So, what kind of town is it?
Do they have tasty food?</b>

02:16.060 --> 02:17.550
<b>There's nothing in that town.</b>

02:23.240 --> 02:26.300
<b>That's right, there was
nothing in that place.</b>

02:44.690 --> 02:46.180
<b>Oh, man...</b>

02:47.930 --> 02:49.730
<b>Must be the work of demons.</b>

02:57.840 --> 02:59.330
<b>This is awful.</b>

03:00.080 --> 03:01.840
<b>Are we actually going to get to eat?</b>

03:06.310 --> 03:07.680
<b>I'm sorry. I'll be right back.</b>

03:07.680 --> 03:07.820
<b>Hey, Hakkai!
I'm sorry. I'll be right back.</b>

03:07.820 --> 03:09.310
<b>Hey, Hakkai!</b>

03:19.160 --> 03:20.760
<b>Right turn here!</b>

03:20.760 --> 03:23.090
<b>Turn at the corner there
and go up three blocks!</b>

03:46.420 --> 03:49.580
<b>Thank goodness, it's safe.</b>

03:52.130 --> 03:53.860
<b>Oh, everyone.</b>

03:53.860 --> 03:55.960
<b>What's the matter, Hakkai?</b>

03:55.960 --> 03:58.330
<b>No, it's nothing.</b>

03:58.330 --> 04:01.360
<b>Gonou? You're Gonou, aren't you?</b>

04:10.710 --> 04:13.680
<b>You're Shaohei!</b>

04:13.680 --> 04:16.520
<b>So it really is you, Gonou!</b>

04:23.630 --> 04:28.260
<b>That lady called him
Gonou instead of Hakkai.</b>

04:28.260 --> 04:31.800
<b>Hey, does that mean she's an
acquaintance from a long time ago?</b>

04:31.800 --> 04:34.870
<b>You can be so naive sometimes Goku.</b>

04:34.870 --> 04:38.610
<b>Judging from the look of things,
she's not just an acquaintance.</b>

04:38.610 --> 04:39.610
<b>I'd say she's more like a former girl...</b>

04:39.610 --> 04:40.110
<b>That's enough!
I'd say she's more like a former girl...</b>

04:40.110 --> 04:41.470
<b>That's enough!</b>

04:42.380 --> 04:44.710
<b>If you've got time for
worthless speculation,</b>

04:44.710 --> 04:46.910
<b>use it to worry about where
we'll sleep tonight!</b>

04:50.890 --> 04:52.750
<b>Aren't you evacuating?</b>

04:53.320 --> 04:55.390
<b>It isn't as if I have
anywhere else to go,</b>

04:55.390 --> 04:59.630
<b>and besides, I feel safer in
that place than elsewhere.</b>

04:59.630 --> 05:04.570
<b>But what a surprise, I never
expected you to be a Sister.</b>

05:04.570 --> 05:09.400
<b>After you left the orphanage, I left too,</b>

05:09.400 --> 05:12.810
<b>but I ended up coming back.</b>

05:12.810 --> 05:14.140
<b>Why?</b>

05:14.140 --> 05:14.310
<b>Because I didn't find a
nice man, maybe?
Why?</b>

05:14.310 --> 05:17.280
<b>Because I didn't find a
nice man, maybe?</b>

05:19.080 --> 05:22.720
<b>Just kidding! Sister actually
asked me back.</b>

05:22.720 --> 05:25.550
<b>Besides, I like children.</b>

05:25.550 --> 05:29.680
<b>You were always good about
taking care of others, Shaohei.</b>

05:31.490 --> 05:32.960
<b>A smile...</b>

05:33.500 --> 05:36.260
<b>You've changed, Gonou.</b>

05:36.260 --> 05:39.000
<b>Yes, perhaps I have.</b>

05:39.000 --> 05:40.970
<b>You're much more wonderful this way.</b>

05:41.840 --> 05:45.970
<b>That is... Do you remember how you
used to be as a child?</b>

05:45.970 --> 05:49.080
<b>You were always so sullen.</b>

05:49.080 --> 05:51.640
<b>Yes, I remember well.</b>

06:04.560 --> 06:07.730
<b>Please, change the order of my turn!</b>

06:07.730 --> 06:11.770
<b>What's the matter? It isn't
like you, Shaohei.</b>

06:11.770 --> 06:15.200
<b>Sister, I don't want to be
on duty with Gonou.</b>

06:15.200 --> 06:18.610
<b>Why not? Gonou's a smart
and serious child.</b>

06:18.610 --> 06:24.070
<b>But he's scary, because
he never, ever smiles.</b>

06:27.180 --> 06:29.150
<b>Listen to me, Shaohei.</b>

06:29.150 --> 06:31.910
<b>You mustn't say such things
in front of other people.</b>

06:38.360 --> 06:39.830
<b>Gonou...</b>

06:41.000 --> 06:42.460
<b>May I have a moment?</b>

06:45.900 --> 06:48.270
<b>You have invitations from
prestigious academies</b>

06:48.270 --> 06:50.670
<b>who think highly of your
scholastic abilities.</b>

06:50.670 --> 06:54.910
<b>But Gonou, will you be all right
when you've left this place?</b>

06:54.910 --> 06:58.450
<b>If you love those around you,
God will watch over you.</b>

06:58.450 --> 07:01.980
<b>Continuing to close your heart
the way you do now will only...</b>

07:01.980 --> 07:04.210
<b>Even if God really does exist...</b>

07:05.520 --> 07:07.290
<b>He's an incompetent.</b>

07:07.290 --> 07:08.760
<b>Gonou...</b>

07:11.430 --> 07:13.550
<b>You must love to be loved.</b>

07:14.830 --> 07:16.260
<b>Poor child.</b>

07:23.040 --> 07:26.500
<b>Say, Gonou, why don't you smile?</b>

07:29.840 --> 07:32.470
<b>Let me ask you, why do you smile?</b>

07:40.860 --> 07:44.620
<b>Do you remember what you said then?</b>

07:45.690 --> 07:48.530
<b>What was going through
your mind back then?</b>

07:48.530 --> 07:51.500
<b>What's the point of asking that now?</b>

07:52.530 --> 07:56.600
<b>There's a child who said
the same thing as you.</b>

07:58.140 --> 07:58.840
<b>All right!</b>

07:58.840 --> 08:00.110
<b>Here goes!
All right!</b>

08:00.110 --> 08:00.340
<b>Here goes!
Just a bit more!</b>

08:00.340 --> 08:01.570
<b>Just a bit more!</b>

08:02.680 --> 08:04.380
<b>What's up, Goku?</b>

08:04.380 --> 08:06.210
<b>What's that over there?</b>

08:06.210 --> 08:09.750
<b>What are you, an idiot? It's normal
to fix things that are broken.</b>

08:09.750 --> 08:12.550
<b>No! That's not what I
meant! Over there!</b>

08:15.920 --> 08:17.390
<b>Goddess statues?</b>

08:19.330 --> 08:23.670
<b>Hey, man, what's that group
of beauties over there?</b>

08:23.670 --> 08:25.600
<b>Oh, that?</b>

08:25.600 --> 08:29.040
<b>Those are goddess statues
to keep the demons away.</b>

08:29.040 --> 08:31.640
<b>They're apparently
imbued with holy power</b>

08:31.640 --> 08:33.870
<b>and the demons are
powerless before them.</b>

08:35.740 --> 08:39.140
<b>They're going to line them up all
around the perimeter of town.</b>

08:42.880 --> 08:45.290
<b>But do these things really work?</b>

08:45.290 --> 08:49.520
<b>They don't seem to
work on us at any rate.</b>

08:49.520 --> 08:51.050
<b>I'm sure they'll
provide some comfort.</b>

08:51.730 --> 08:53.160
<b>What are you doing?
I'm leaving you behind.</b>

08:53.730 --> 08:55.200
<b>Wait up!</b>

08:56.000 --> 08:59.060
<b>Oh, my, you've grown so.</b>

08:59.930 --> 09:02.270
<b>Sister, I'm glad to see
you're well too.</b>

09:04.840 --> 09:07.710
<b>It's been so long, Gonou.</b>

09:09.180 --> 09:10.980
<b>Will you be able to
stay for a while?</b>

09:10.980 --> 09:15.520
<b>I'm sorry. I'm in the middle of a
journey with some friends, so...</b>

09:15.520 --> 09:20.420
<b>Oh, but you have time for
some tea at least, don't you?</b>

09:20.420 --> 09:22.620
<b>Yes, I have time enough for that.</b>

09:23.190 --> 09:24.690
<b>Big Sister!</b>

09:24.690 --> 09:28.700
<b>Hurry, hurry! You promised
to draw pictures with us!</b>

09:28.700 --> 09:30.270
<b>Yes, yes.</b>

09:30.270 --> 09:34.170
<b>Well, Gonou, I'll be
back in time for tea.</b>

09:35.540 --> 09:39.970
<b>I have some wonderful tea, so
please look forward to it.</b>

09:39.970 --> 09:41.440
<b>I will.</b>

09:43.910 --> 09:46.780
<b>She hasn't changed at all.</b>

09:48.920 --> 09:52.920
<b>Shaohei, where's the
boy you talked about?</b>

09:52.920 --> 09:55.150
<b>Yes, I'll take you to him right away.</b>

10:16.240 --> 10:17.710
<b>Are you Linchei?</b>

10:19.950 --> 10:21.440
<b>Hello.</b>

10:22.320 --> 10:25.290
<b>I don't know what those
people told you,</b>

10:25.290 --> 10:26.750
<b>but you're probably wasting your time.</b>

10:28.160 --> 10:30.350
<b>I don't believe in God.</b>

10:31.360 --> 10:36.190
<b>Don't worry, I'm not here
to talk about that.</b>

10:44.170 --> 10:46.540
<b>You don't seem very
comfortable in this place.</b>

10:47.740 --> 10:50.140
<b>I used to be that way too.</b>

10:50.140 --> 10:53.810
<b>I was once cared for here as
well, just as you are now.</b>

10:55.720 --> 10:57.180
<b>I looked in your eyes, and I knew.</b>

10:57.950 --> 11:02.460
<b>Linchei, you're exactly like
me when I was younger.</b>

11:02.460 --> 11:04.260
<b>What are you trying to say?</b>

11:04.260 --> 11:08.820
<b>A principle of appearances, not
looking at the ugly things.</b>

11:09.530 --> 11:13.430
<b>The Sisters, who only provide you
with charity that is hypocrisy.</b>

11:14.940 --> 11:16.470
<b>The children in the same
circumstance as you,</b>

11:16.470 --> 11:19.470
<b>who have no doubts whatsoever.</b>

11:19.470 --> 11:21.180
<b>And most of all, yourself,</b>

11:21.180 --> 11:24.470
<b>having no choice but to depend
on the sympathy of others.</b>

11:26.080 --> 11:28.380
<b>If only everything would
just fall to ruin.</b>

11:29.020 --> 11:30.480
<b>That's what you're thinking, isn't it?</b>

11:32.150 --> 11:35.120
<b>I understand why you'd
feel so self-destructive.</b>

11:35.120 --> 11:36.760
<b>Everyone who comes here</b>

11:36.760 --> 11:39.730
<b>has been burdened with some
measure of unhappiness after all.</b>

11:40.860 --> 11:41.530
<b>But...</b>

11:41.530 --> 11:42.360
<b>But?
But...</b>

11:42.360 --> 11:43.030
<b>But?</b>

11:43.030 --> 11:44.670
<b>Then you're the same!</b>

11:44.670 --> 11:46.630
<b>You're the same as those Sisters!</b>

11:48.170 --> 11:49.800
<b>Listen to me, Linchei.</b>

11:49.800 --> 11:52.770
<b>I don't want to hear it!
You're on the other side too!</b>

11:52.770 --> 11:53.810
<b>Linchei!</b>

11:53.810 --> 11:54.280
<b>If only it would all disappear!
Linchei!</b>

11:54.280 --> 11:55.480
<b>If only it would all disappear!</b>

11:55.480 --> 11:58.910
<b>The orphanage, the hypocrites,
the entire town!</b>

11:58.910 --> 12:03.450
<b>Destroying this world won't
bring the world you desire!</b>

12:03.450 --> 12:05.650
<b>Any place would be better than this!</b>

12:12.860 --> 12:14.060
<b>Gonou...</b>

12:14.060 --> 12:14.360
<b>Shaohei...
Gonou...</b>

12:14.360 --> 12:15.520
<b>Shaohei...</b>

12:17.830 --> 12:19.730
<b>So you were listening?</b>

12:19.730 --> 12:21.070
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

12:21.070 --> 12:21.240
<b>It's all right, because it
makes us even now.
I'm sorry.</b>

12:21.240 --> 12:24.540
<b>It's all right, because it
makes us even now.</b>

12:24.540 --> 12:25.640
<b>Even?</b>

12:25.640 --> 12:26.040
<b>No, I'm just talking to myself.
Even?</b>

12:26.040 --> 12:27.270
<b>No, I'm just talking to myself.</b>

12:29.880 --> 12:32.080
<b>Well, Gonou...</b>

12:32.080 --> 12:33.110
<b>Yes?</b>

12:33.110 --> 12:33.580
<b>Is that what you used to think?
Yes?</b>

12:33.580 --> 12:35.910
<b>Is that what you used to think?</b>

12:38.790 --> 12:41.950
<b>In a general sort of way,
I suppose so.</b>

12:42.660 --> 12:47.300
<b>But his case seems to be
slightly different than mine.</b>

12:47.300 --> 12:48.800
<b>What should I do?!</b>

12:48.800 --> 12:50.800
<b>What can I do to save that child?!</b>

12:50.800 --> 12:54.430
<b>What can be done so that child will
smile again, as you learned to do?!</b>

13:02.380 --> 13:04.110
<b>That's a difficult question.</b>

13:05.280 --> 13:07.270
<b>I want to save him.</b>

13:08.250 --> 13:11.620
<b>You won't be able to save
him with superficiality.</b>

13:12.450 --> 13:16.220
<b>Please try to treat him with as
much sincerity as possible.</b>

13:16.220 --> 13:18.250
<b>That's about all I can tell you.</b>

13:20.290 --> 13:23.990
<b>Don't worry, I'll do what I can as well.</b>

13:25.770 --> 13:27.230
<b>Gonou...</b>

13:29.270 --> 13:31.340
<b>Oh, Hakkai, welcome back.</b>

13:31.340 --> 13:34.640
<b>I'm sorry I'm so late.</b>

13:34.640 --> 13:37.580
<b>So, are you finished with
your business?</b>

13:37.580 --> 13:39.580
<b>Yes, for today.</b>

13:39.580 --> 13:41.420
<b>I see.</b>

13:41.420 --> 13:45.890
<b>Only, his brooding expression
bothers me slightly.</b>

13:45.890 --> 13:47.720
<b>Then shall we go out to eat?</b>

13:47.720 --> 13:50.660
<b>All right! Let's go! Let's go!</b>

13:50.660 --> 13:52.130
<b>A smile?</b>

14:09.110 --> 14:10.540
<b>I just wanted to meet someone.</b>

14:11.980 --> 14:13.610
<b>Someone to whom I
could open my heart.</b>

14:17.490 --> 14:19.680
<b>But they have no faces.</b>

14:26.090 --> 14:27.560
<b>I'm all alone.</b>

14:34.970 --> 14:36.440
<b>Snow...</b>

14:40.610 --> 14:43.080
<b>Man, I'm stuffed!</b>

14:43.080 --> 14:44.540
<b>Gonou!</b>

14:46.180 --> 14:47.980
<b>Shaohei!</b>

14:47.980 --> 14:49.650
<b>He's disappeared?!</b>

14:49.650 --> 14:52.890
<b>I looked in on all the rooms just
now, and Linchei alone was...</b>

14:52.890 --> 14:55.360
<b>Do you have any ideas?</b>

14:57.190 --> 14:59.960
<b>Shaohei, please go back.</b>

14:59.960 --> 15:02.700
<b>I'll bring Linchei back,
no matter what.</b>

15:02.700 --> 15:03.700
<b>But...</b>

15:03.700 --> 15:04.200
<b>It's okay, please leave it to me.
But...</b>

15:04.200 --> 15:06.170
<b>It's okay, please leave it to me.</b>

15:33.560 --> 15:35.030
<b>Destroying this world...</b>

15:37.330 --> 15:41.730
<b>Destroying this world won't
bring the world you desire.</b>

15:42.840 --> 15:44.870
<b>The world I desire?!</b>

15:44.870 --> 15:47.940
<b>What I desire is the
destruction of this world!</b>

15:47.940 --> 15:51.610
<b>So your plan is to get the
demons to destroy this town?</b>

15:54.450 --> 15:56.980
<b>Let me tell you something, Linchei.</b>

15:56.980 --> 15:59.450
<b>That will change nothing.</b>

15:59.450 --> 16:01.320
<b>If you want to change something,</b>

16:01.320 --> 16:03.160
<b>you ought to do it
with your own strength.</b>

16:03.160 --> 16:04.660
<b>Leave me alone!</b>

16:04.660 --> 16:07.860
<b>If I'm going to have to keep
living like this, I'd rather...</b>

16:07.860 --> 16:10.300
<b>Would you rather die?</b>

16:11.500 --> 16:13.770
<b>Then die alone.</b>

16:13.770 --> 16:18.710
<b>You shouldn't endanger other
people because of your selfishness.</b>

16:18.710 --> 16:21.940
<b>Shut up. Shut up. Shut up.</b>

16:21.940 --> 16:23.410
<b>Shut up!</b>

16:32.420 --> 16:33.890
<b>Do you feel better now?</b>

16:41.330 --> 16:45.420
<b>Demons! They were probably watching
from the outskirts of town.</b>

16:46.930 --> 16:49.640
<b>Where are you going?</b>

16:49.640 --> 16:51.100
<b>You want to die, don't you?</b>

16:54.940 --> 16:57.240
<b>Thanks for doing the job for us.</b>

16:57.240 --> 16:59.780
<b>We were having trouble
with those statues.</b>

16:59.780 --> 17:01.480
<b>Now, we'll be free to...</b>

17:04.820 --> 17:08.120
<b>You should be experiencing terror
with your entire being right now.</b>

17:09.590 --> 17:12.180
<b>And the fact that you're powerless.</b>

17:16.260 --> 17:18.230
<b>Grow stronger.</b>

17:18.230 --> 17:20.870
<b>Lamenting the present
and sulking about it</b>

17:20.870 --> 17:22.340
<b>isn't going to change anything.</b>

17:23.200 --> 17:24.770
<b>Stronger...</b>

17:24.770 --> 17:27.370
<b>Hey, you bastards, how
dare you ignore us?!</b>

17:27.370 --> 17:29.740
<b>Think about the situation
you're in right now!</b>

17:29.740 --> 17:31.910
<b>Would you please be
quiet for a moment?</b>

17:34.350 --> 17:37.040
<b>Don't mess with us! Get them!</b>

17:45.030 --> 17:46.530
<b>Do you see now?</b>

17:46.530 --> 17:49.160
<b>Death isn't such a simple matter.</b>

17:53.370 --> 17:55.340
<b>Then please stand back.</b>

17:55.340 --> 17:57.100
<b>I'll take care of the rest somehow.</b>

18:10.380 --> 18:12.480
<b>Fighting alone is pretty exhausting.</b>

18:13.550 --> 18:15.020
<b>Oh, no!</b>

18:15.990 --> 18:19.520
<b>If I'm going to die anyway,
I'll take you with me!</b>

18:21.360 --> 18:22.830
<b>Die!</b>

18:27.030 --> 18:28.540
<b>I won't let you kill this child!</b>

18:28.540 --> 18:29.540
<b>Shaohei!</b>

18:29.540 --> 18:30.040
<b>Sister...
Shaohei!</b>

18:30.040 --> 18:31.000
<b>Sister...</b>

18:38.110 --> 18:39.700
<b>Gojyo! Everyone!</b>

18:42.220 --> 18:46.420
<b>Good grief, I came out to
get some fresh night air,</b>

18:46.420 --> 18:49.460
<b>and I end up running
across this event.</b>

18:49.460 --> 18:51.630
<b>I was just looking for
a midnight snack.</b>

18:51.630 --> 18:53.090
<b>I ran out of cigarettes.</b>

19:01.070 --> 19:02.540
<b>Sister...</b>

19:04.240 --> 19:07.940
<b>Well then, everyone, shall we
hurry up and take care of this?</b>

19:09.080 --> 19:10.540
<b>Roger that!</b>

19:20.450 --> 19:25.030
<b>I'm sorry for putting
all of you in danger.</b>

19:25.030 --> 19:29.730
<b>Who ever heard of a person
apologizing after saving the town?</b>

19:29.730 --> 19:31.660
<b>I hadn't intended it that way.</b>

19:32.770 --> 19:35.270
<b>Gonou, thank you for everything.</b>

19:35.270 --> 19:36.800
<b>Not at all.</b>

19:36.800 --> 19:38.270
<b>About that child...</b>

19:38.870 --> 19:42.010
<b>Don't worry, as long
as you're with him,</b>

19:42.010 --> 19:44.210
<b>the day will surely come
when he can smile again.</b>

19:44.210 --> 19:45.700
<b>I...</b>

19:46.910 --> 19:48.350
<b>Have confidence.</b>

19:49.450 --> 19:52.350
<b>There was nothing insincere
about what you did last night.</b>

19:52.350 --> 19:56.220
<b>I think Linchei understands
that better than anyone.</b>

19:57.090 --> 19:58.560
<b>Gonou!</b>

19:59.660 --> 20:01.500
<b>Please take care of Linchei.</b>

20:01.500 --> 20:02.960
<b>Yes!</b>

20:04.630 --> 20:06.570
<b>The snow certainly has accumulated.</b>

20:07.230 --> 20:10.940
<b>Oh, that's right, I'd forgotten
to mention something.</b>

20:10.940 --> 20:13.410
<b>I changed my name.</b>

20:13.410 --> 20:16.610
<b>My current name is Hakkai,</b>

20:16.610 --> 20:18.080
<b>Cho Hakkai.</b>

20:28.820 --> 20:30.290
<b>Thank you.</b>

20:45.170 --> 20:54.010
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

20:55.350 --> 21:05.780
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:07.130 --> 21:17.260
<b>Emotions like the sand
spilling out of my hands</b>

21:18.570 --> 21:31.590
<b>The words that pierced my
heart back then suddenly ache</b>

21:31.590 --> 21:43.030
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:43.030 --> 21:54.310
<b>The more I lose, the more
certain this feeling becomes</b>

21:54.310 --> 22:06.480
<b>Now, I can surely
walk on and on forever</b>
